{"id":"c-sanguozhi-022-luyu:p002:m0255","start":255,"end":256,"surface":"植","kind":"person","person_id":"m8n_ntm_79h","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-022-luyu:p002:u0257","start":257,"end":259,"surface":"四子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"原文總子數四已另存 family_count_reports；此群體原詞不作單一人物，三位未名子不造profile，不補其名或生母。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-022-luyu:p002:m0259","start":259,"end":260,"surface":"毓","kind":"person","person_id":"m8n_ntm_79h_A","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"source_position":{"first_line":432,"last_line":439,"source_layer":"pei_annotation","unit_key":"luyu-unit-02","raw_projection_ref":"source-evidence/sanguozhi022-luyu-projection.json"},"chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-022-luyu","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-022","work_id":"w-sanguozhi","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-022-luyu"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:p030","text":"西伯歸，乃陰修德行善，諸侯多叛紂而往歸西伯。西伯滋大，紂由是稍失權重。王子比干諫，弗聽。商容賢者，百姓愛之，紂廢之。及西伯伐飢國，滅之，紂之臣祖伊聞之而咎周，恐，奔告紂曰：「天既訖我殷命，假人元龜，無敢知吉，非先王不相我後人，維王淫虐用自絕，故天棄我，不有安食，不虞知天性，不迪率典。今我民罔不欲喪，曰『天曷不降威，大命胡不至』？今王其柰何？」紂曰：「我生不有命在天乎！」祖伊反，曰：「紂不可諫矣。」西伯既卒，周武王之東伐，至盟津，諸侯叛殷會周者八百。諸侯皆曰：「紂可伐矣。」武王曰：「爾未知天命。」乃復歸。","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m030-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"西伯","kind":"person","person_id":"y4i_pjk_4gn_A","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m030-0015","start":15,"end":16,"surface":"紂","kind":"person","person_id":"lwx_9yq_ad7","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m030-0019","start":19,"end":21,"surface":"西伯","kind":"person","person_id":"y4i_pjk_4gn_A","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m030-0022","start":22,"end":24,"surface":"西伯","kind":"person","person_id":"y4i_pjk_4gn_A","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m030-0027","start":27,"end":28,"surface":"紂","kind":"person","person_id":"lwx_9yq_ad7","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m030-0035","start":35,"end":39,"surface":"王子比干","kind":"person","person_id":"xtq_oi8_w82","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-